        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omushaija ayasirwe eihasha anga ashazirweho obushaija atalitaha mu nteko ya Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana w'ensinjo atalitaha mu nteko ya Mukama; nangu kulemwa kuturuka aha muzarwa gwa ikumi thaliho mwijukuru n'omoi alitaha mu nteko ya Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thaliho Mwamoni anga Mumoabu kutaha mu nteko ya Mukama; nangu kulemwa kuturuka n'aha muzarwa gwa ikumi, taliho muntu n'omoi ali wabo alitaha mu nteko ya Mukama eirai lyona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba tibabahaire kyakulya na maizi orwo mwabaire nimuruga Misiri, kandi bakabagulilira Balaamu mutabani wa Beori owa Petori omuli Mesopotamia kubaraama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Omukama Ruhanga wanyu tiyahuliire Balaamu. Akaba nabagonza, omuraamo yaguhindura mugisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro byona mutalibajuna anga kutunda nabo kubatungisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalinuga Baedomu kuba ni barumuna banyu. Mutalinuga Bamisiri ahakuba mukaba mufurukire omu nsi yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana babo ab'omuzarwa gwa kashatu bakutaha omu nteko y'Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'orabaga oli omu ndashana oyelinde ekintu kyona kyona ekibi omu rusisira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'omuli inywe omushaija alihagara aha rw'enshonga y'okurotelera omu kiro akarugwamu amaizi g'oruzaro, aruge omu rusisira, atalitahamu rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabuliba bwaigoro ayoge; orwo eizoba liliba lyatobeire, yakutaha omu rusisira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mugire omwanya enjai y'orusisira mube niyo mwejuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bikwato byanyu mugiremu omushote; k'oligya aheru kwejuna ogulimise ekina, oshube omwejuno gwawe ogusangire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Omukama Ruhanga wanyu ali hamoi nainywe omu rusisira rwanyu kubarokora mukasinga ababisha banyu. Aha rw'ekyo orusisira rwanyu ruragiirwe kuba rutakatifu, atalija akabonamu kihagaro akashubayo akabasigaho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omwiru ayairuka mukamawe akaija ahali iwe otalimugarura wa mukamawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigo ekilimushemelera akaba nikyo arondaho muture nawe; otalimugingiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu Baisiraeli hatalibamu mumalaya wa rwensinga anga nsiyaga ya rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otalileta mperwa ya malaya anga mperwa ya nsiyaga omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama Ruhanga wawe kugobesheleza kiragano; aha rw'okuba byombili ebyo binyamunuge aha Mukama Ruhanga wawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Othalihora murumuna wawe okenda magoba; amagoba aha mahera, amagoba aha byakulya, amagoba aha kintu kyona kyona eky'okuhorwa kwihyamu amagoba ago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyamahanga wakumuhora oyenda amagoba, kyonkai Omwisiraeli murumuna wawe otalimuhora okenda magoba; nirwo Omukama Ruhanga wawe aliha emilimo yawe yona omugisha omu nsi ey'olikutahamu kulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'olikolera Omukama Ruhanga wawe endagano otalizebera kugigobesheleza; aha rw'okuba aligikubaza, mara omushango gulikukwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai k'olyelinda okuragana, tolikwatwa mushango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyegendeleze kugobesheleza ekirugire omu kanwa kawe, okeyendera okagira ekyo waraganira Omukama Ruhanga wawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'olitaha omu ndimiro ya mutahi wawe y'emizabibu, wakulya ezabibu zingi nk'okwo olikwenda oiguta, kyonkai otakugira zowata mu kikwato kutwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'olitaha omu musiri gw'engano, wakuguturamu kyonkai obigutuze emikono, omusiligwe otaligutamu rwabyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
